    correct: 1,
    explanation: 'The core problems Vertex AI Feature Store solves: (1) Training/serving skew, features are defined once, eliminating divergence between offline training transforms and online serving code; (2) Reuse, teams share features across projects via a central registry rather than recomputing them; (3) Point-in-time correctness, feature store supports time-travel snapshots for backfill training data without future data leakage; (4) Low-latency online serving, features are available via the online store for <10ms lookup during inference. Source: Vertex AI Feature Store documentation, Professional ML Engineer Exam Guide.',
